==Rules==
{{StageRule|Summer}}

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Gavel Base (Enemy Base)|Gavel Base]].
*4 [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*6 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**12 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

